{"3955150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Our Mother Lilith : The Vampire Exegesis", "steam_appid": 3955150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/d5d5d63cc3abb34197688697144913c3.avif?t=1786032864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras_big/d5d5d63cc3abb34197688697144913c3.webp?t=1786032864 width=1560 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                <i>Our Mother Lilith</i></strong><i> is a Third Person Shooter inspired by the <strong>early 2000'</strong>s science fiction movies and games, with a focus on freedom of movement and creativity during combat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>                           After centuries of sleep waiting for a cure to a holy spell consuming her, a vampire warrior emerges in a world now ruled by what has become of her former brethen. Having rewritten all liturgy, with their body transformed  through alchemy, a<strong> </strong>church of vampires  distribute the blood, reigning through faith and machines. With her time running out, she must find the promised remedy while facing a clergy that will do anything in its power to prevent the past from surfacing again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/8465ca865c110ce0e122b703e9be649c.webp?t=1786032864\" width=395 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Adapt to your enemies by combining old relics and advanced weapons</strong> : Alternate fluidly between your ancient <strong>vampiric artefacts</strong> to slice through your opponents up close and <strong>firearms</strong> to reach them at distance. Every weapon has its own niche and <strong>special ability</strong> : grappling hook, UV light, stealth shield…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/40464beefa70fd2fd85776f508a363cc.poster.avif?t=1786032864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/40464beefa70fd2fd85776f508a363cc.webm?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/40464beefa70fd2fd85776f508a363cc.mp4?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/dead0d1c8d67f73a2c052d1ee41329ad.webp?t=1786032864\" width=351 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>-Blitz through you foes as an almighty vampire</strong> : move at inhumane speed, <strong>fly</strong>, <strong>run on walls</strong>, <strong>parry</strong> attacks and even <strong>bullets</strong>. Against the overwhelming forces of the Church, <strong>rely on your agility</strong> to dominate the multitudes with grace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/1ec5dd37b0dc853df141657129d1e362.poster.avif?t=1786032864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/1ec5dd37b0dc853df141657129d1e362.webm?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/1ec5dd37b0dc853df141657129d1e362.mp4?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/a007bebb19a3e78f01acf952e9a92592.webp?t=1786032864\" width=351 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-<strong>Light is both your mortal enemy and your ally </strong>: they will wield it as a <strong>weapon</strong>, but so can you. Watch your shots to <strong>avoid poking holes</strong> in your shelter, or <strong>break barriers</strong> to let the sun take care of your vampiric opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/49c7e6343b3925c5373c57784e128633.poster.avif?t=1786032864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/49c7e6343b3925c5373c57784e128633.webm?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/49c7e6343b3925c5373c57784e128633.mp4?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/09639cc1539ca0232c0c3166e0b5fdf4.webp?t=1786032864\" width=351 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Blood powers the world </strong>: consume it to <strong>mend your wounds</strong> and <strong>conjure powerful magics</strong>, spill it to <strong>activate mechanisms</strong>, but be mindful of where you shed it, as it may <strong>reinforce your enemies</strong> too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/87f9869755b413f73c9cdc192c97379b.poster.avif?t=1786032864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/87f9869755b413f73c9cdc192c97379b.webm?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/87f9869755b413f73c9cdc192c97379b.mp4?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a solo project,</strong> so it might<strong> take a little while.  </strong>Assets and code are entirely<strong> made by a human.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/80844fb815099a5183816d991718d4a3.avif?t=1786032864\" width=620 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/d5d5d63cc3abb34197688697144913c3.avif?t=1786032864\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras_big/d5d5d63cc3abb34197688697144913c3.webp?t=1786032864 width=1560 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>                <i>Our Mother Lilith</i></strong><i> is a Third Person Shooter inspired by the <strong>early 2000'</strong>s science fiction movies and games, with a focus on freedom of movement and creativity during combat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>                           After centuries of sleep waiting for a cure to a holy spell consuming her, a vampire warrior emerges in a world now ruled by what has become of her former brethen. Having rewritten all liturgy, with their body transformed  through alchemy, a<strong> </strong>church of vampires  distribute the blood, reigning through faith and machines. With her time running out, she must find the promised remedy while facing a clergy that will do anything in its power to prevent the past from surfacing again.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/8465ca865c110ce0e122b703e9be649c.webp?t=1786032864\" width=395 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Adapt to your enemies by combining old relics and advanced weapons</strong> : Alternate fluidly between your ancient <strong>vampiric artefacts</strong> to slice through your opponents up close and <strong>firearms</strong> to reach them at distance. Every weapon has its own niche and <strong>special ability</strong> : grappling hook, UV light, stealth shield…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/40464beefa70fd2fd85776f508a363cc.poster.avif?t=1786032864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955150/extras/40464beefa70fd2fd85776f508a363cc.webm?t=1786032864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store